  "content_html": "<p>&nbsp;<span style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</span><img border=\"0\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhjiYJPAm84oR3355jnNlHmNwiPqVmvALUOfbGD4zU52Ki1L4KhkX-u7PehC4FMyNeLEWRp7902hChkHdOJkXbvYISL4fC3sW1R-KGIJ0pmghlHxc-GjbvJnWnrLtbgtAorCJfU9-uyj4NXxingMIUxQOuOLMcckSrr5WGrDqnQRyK-xKVDlJtvJuN8_pQ/w200-h183/%E2%80%8F%E2%80%8F%D7%9C%D7%9B%D7%99%D7%93%D7%94.PNG\" style=\"text-align: center;\" /></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><h2><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc; font-family: arial;\">🕯️ מעט מן האור</span></h2><p><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">גֵּר - לֹא תִּלְחַץ,<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">שֹׁחַד - לֹא תִּקַּח,<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">וּמִדְּבַר שֶׁקֶר - תִּרְחַק.&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">וְהַכּוֹרֶה אֶת הַבּוֹר,<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">וְהַגֹּנֵב אֶת הַשּׁוֹר,<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">וְהַנּוֹתֵן בְּהֵמָה לִשְׁמֹר -&nbsp;<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">כֻּלָּם בֶּאֱמֶת וּבְמִישׁוֹר.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">וְכִי יְפַתֶּה,<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">וְיוּמַת הַמַּכֶּה,&nbsp;<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">וְאִם אָסוֹן יִהְיֶה -&nbsp;<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">צֶדֶק יֵרָאֶה וְיֵעָשֶׂה.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">שֻׁלְחָן עָרוּךְ טְעָמִים,<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">וְהַדִּין נָדוֹן בִּפְלִלִים -<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">כִּי אֵלֶּה הַמִּשְׁפָּטִים<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">לְחֶבְרָה חֲפֵצַת חַיִּים.</span></p><h2 style=\"text-align: right;\"><span face=\"Arial, sans-serif\" style=\"background-color: #fff2cc; font-family: arial;\">📘 עצה שבועית</span></h2><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><b>הִכָּנֵס לַנַּעֲלַיִם שֶׁל הַשֵּׁנִי - לִפְנֵי שֶׁאַתָּה שׁוֹפֵט.<br /></b></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">הֲבָנָה מַקְדִּימָה חוֹסֶכֶת מַחְלֹקֶת וּמְרַכֶּכֶת אֶת הַדִּין.</span></p><p></p><h2 style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc;\">🌀 הצד השני של המטבע</span></h2><p><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc; font-family: arial;\"></span></p><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">מִי שֶׁמְּחַפֵּשׂ אַשְׁמָה - מוֹצֵא מְרִיבָה;<br />מִי שֶׁמְּחַפֵּשׂ אֱמֶת - מוֹצֵא אֲנָשִׁים.</span><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><h2 style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc;\">💎 פנינה</span></h2><p>\"<i>וְאֵלֶּה הַמִּשְׁפָּטִים אֲשֶׁר</i>\" = 1027 = \"<i>וַתְּאַזְּרֵנִי שִׂמְחָה</i>\"</p><p>שהרי כבר נאמר: \"פִּקּוּדֵי ה' יְשָׁרִים מְשַׂמְּחֵי לֵב\" (תהילים י\"ט ט)</p><h2 style=\"background: 0px 0px rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 23px; line-height: 1.3em; margin: 0px 0px 20px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px rgb(255, 242, 204); border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">📘 מילון ארמי־עברי</span></h2><p style=\"background: 0px 0px white; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 15px; margin: 0px 0px 25px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: arial; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><i style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">חמש מילים מארמית שבתורה - עם פענוח והארה לשונית.</i></span></p><p style=\"background: 0px 0px white; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 15px; margin: 0px 0px 25px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"></p><p><b><span face=\"Arial, sans-serif\"></span></b></p><ol style=\"box-sizing: border-box; counter-reset: templateify 0; margin: 10px 0px; padding: 0px 20px 0px 0px;\"><li><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"background-attachment: initial; background-clip: initial; background-image: initial; background-origin: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-repeat: initial; background-size: initial; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background-color: white;\"><span>'</span><span><b>מִּשְׁפָּטִים</b>' / '</span><span><b>דִּינַיָּא</b>'</span></span><br /></span></span><span style=\"background-color: white;\">❖ חוקים - דינים</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"background-attachment: initial; background-clip: initial; background-image: initial; background-origin: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-repeat: initial; background-size: initial; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background-color: white;\">'<b>תָּשִׂים</b>' / '<b>תַסְדַּר</b>'</span><br /></span></span><span style=\"background: 0px 0px white; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">❖&nbsp;</span><span style=\"background-color: white;\">תניח - תסדר במקומו</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"background-color: white;\">'</span><span style=\"background-color: white;\"><b>צָדָה</b>' / '<b>כְּמַן</b>'</span><br /></span><span style=\"background-color: white;\">❖ ציד, מארב - מכמונת</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"background-attachment: initial; background-clip: initial; background-image: initial; background-origin: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-repeat: initial; background-size: initial; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span><span style=\"background-color: white;\">'<b>בְעָרְמָה</b>' / '<b>בִּנְכִילוּ</b>'</span></span><br /></span></span><span style=\"background: 0px 0px white; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">❖</span><span style=\"background-color: white;\">&nbsp;בחלקלקות - בנכלוליות</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"background-color: white;\">'<b>יְרִיבֻן</b>' / '<b>יִנְצוֹן</b>'</span><br /></span><span style=\"background-color: white;\">❖ ריב, מאבק - מצה</span></li></ol><div><br /></div><h2 style=\"display: inline; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc;\"><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"></span></div>👁️ מבט חד</span><br /></h2><br /></span><table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"tr-caption-container\" style=\"float: right;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgEyZc26MKbcwLppNKbSjN5BqmQsWjWjCE7ihpw2dI-_6Rd5yHVaPzsWcVc0_6OMQpj1CCrEzMjo-syNSXtqVxhVFn_u7FOQjC9MA9MQ4dPHWBOCOhFAA70ECAioFoO_0wQjNEEUnfvGKpkBrUJGwXhot4M-W-45Vkz8kohmQQ9ERa_Mte49QrZKsdSvmQ/s1024/ChatGPT%20Image%20Nov%2021,%202025,%2002_49_25%20PM.png\" style=\"clear: right; margin-bottom: 1em; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\"><img alt=\"איור מחולק לשניים: בצד אחד רחוב נטוש ופרוע עם מדרכה שבורה, עץ עקום, בתים מוזנחים וסדקים בקרקע; בצד השני אותו רחוב מסודר, נקי ורגוע, עם שביל ישר, עצים עומדים זקוף ובתים מטופחים\" border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1024\" data-original-width=\"1024\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgEyZc26MKbcwLppNKbSjN5BqmQsWjWjCE7ihpw2dI-_6Rd5yHVaPzsWcVc0_6OMQpj1CCrEzMjo-syNSXtqVxhVFn_u7FOQjC9MA9MQ4dPHWBOCOhFAA70ECAioFoO_0wQjNEEUnfvGKpkBrUJGwXhot4M-W-45Vkz8kohmQQ9ERa_Mte49QrZKsdSvmQ/w200-h200/ChatGPT%20Image%20Nov%2021,%202025,%2002_49_25%20PM.png\" width=\"200\" /></a></td></tr><tr><td class=\"tr-caption\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"background-color: white; color: #202122;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">\"וַיְקַו לְמִשְׁפָּט וְהִנֵּה מִשְׂפָּח לִצְדָקָה וְהִנֵּה צְעָקָה\"</span></span></td></tr></tbody></table><br /></div></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div style=\"text-align: right;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><br /></div></div></div>"
}
